+ * panic_logfb.c - draw the kernel log on the framebuffer when the kernel panics.
+ *
+ * Debugging aid for devices without a serial console: the last lines of the
+ * kernel log are rendered with an embedded 8x8 font to the first registered
+ * framebuffer, so a panic can be read/photographed from the screen.
+ */
